  "_approach": "Sara Landry's 'loop every three bars for a gallop-y feeling' applied to percussion: a 12-step (three-beat) rim figure and a clave cycle roll across three bars against the 4/4 kick and rigid offbeat hats, so the accents drift and resolve only every 3 bars. Reference: Sara Landry (Ableton interview), Klangkuenstler. (re-voiced for the Vermona DRM1 MKIII's 8 channels)",
